# Editorial content store LEGACY mirror scratch dir (Phase B, mirror mode).
# Anchored to repo root so the shopify_content/content_store package is tracked.
# NOTE: the Phase C authoritative worktree is /content/ and is intentionally
# NOT ignored — it is version-controlled (Git is the editorial source of truth).
/content_store/

.venv/
node_modules/
cms_ui/frontend/node_modules/
.ipynb_checkpoints/
Untitled*.ipynb

Caddyfile
.vscode/
staticfiles/
.cursor/settings.json
.cursor/debug-*.log
.claude/
shopify.app.toml
deploy/*
scripts/

# WARNING (migration policy, Phase C): this rule makes Django migrations
# untracked, which conflicts with treating migrations as version-controlled
# source artifacts. Phase C adds no schema change, so it is left untouched here;
# un-ignoring migrations (while keeping __pycache__/*.pyc ignored) and committing
# the pending catch-up migration should be done in a separate focused commit/PR.
*/migrations/*
bin/*

bin/daphne
bin/daphne_boot.py
